  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I'm sorry about this order, Hannah. I've checked the delivery records, and they match what you said.\n\n**Late delivery:** The order was promised for 6:00 PM, and the courier handed it over at 6:50 PM, so it was 50 minutes late. For deliveries 45 minutes or more late, we give account credit worth 20% of the order subtotal. On your $60.00 subtotal, that's **$12.00**, and I've already added it to your account. You can use it on future orders.\n\n**Missing mango lassi:** One lassi is $4.50. You can choose how to get that back:\n- **A $4.50 refund** to your Visa ending 4242, or\n- **$5.40 in account credit** (the item price plus 20%)\n\nWhich would you prefer? Once you tell me, we can move on to the Pho Real order."
  },
