   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, thanks for the $12 credit on the late delivery. For the missing lassi, I'd take the account credit, since I order a lot from Forkful anyway. I'll go with the $5.40.\n\nNext is yesterday's Burger Barn order. I ordered a veggie burger and got a beef burger instead. I didn't eat it."
