   "text": "I've added the **$5.40 credit** for the missing lassi. Your account credit balance is now **$17.40**.\n\n**Burger Barn (K-6102):** I'm sorry you got a beef burger instead of a veggie burger. I can see the veggie burger on the order at $11.00, and you've reported it in time.\n\nNormally you could choose between an $11.00 refund to your card and $13.20 in account credit. But there's a limit of $25.00 on the total account credit I can add in one conversation. I've already added $17.40 today, and $13.20 more would go over that limit. So for this item, I can only offer:\n\n- **An $11.00 refund** to your Visa ending 4242\n\nShould I go ahead with that refund?"
