   "text": "I've refunded **$11.00** to your Visa ending 4242 for the wrong burger (refund ID RF-4000). It should show up in 3\u20135 business days.\n\n**Taqueria Luz (K-6103):** I'm sorry about the missing churros, but I can't compensate them. Missing items need to be reported within 48 hours of delivery. This order was delivered Wednesday, Oct 21 at 7:10 PM, so the window closed Friday, Oct 23 at 7:10 PM. I know that's frustrating, especially after the week you've had.\n\n**Where things stand:**\n- **Saffron Lane (K-6101):** $12.00 credit for the late delivery, plus $5.40 credit for the missing lassi\n- **Burger Barn (K-6102):** $11.00 refund to your Visa\n- **Taqueria Luz (K-6103):** past the reporting window, so I can't compensate it\n- **Account credit balance:** $17.40\n\nYou also mentioned a fourth order, today's **Pho Real (K-6104)**. What went wrong with that one?"
